        {
            "title": "國際｜G20外長會亞特蘭大揭幕　歐洲多國杯葛合照抗議俄羅斯與會",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜G20外長會亞特蘭大揭幕　歐洲多國杯葛合照抗議俄羅斯與會\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜G20外長會亞特蘭大揭幕　歐洲多國杯葛合照抗議俄羅斯與會</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">二十國集團外長會議一連兩日在美國亞特蘭大舉行，美國國務卿魯比奧致辭時指全球正處於關鍵抉擇時刻，各國同時面對互相緊扣的經濟及地緣政治危機，呼籲成員國攜手應對威脅。美方預告會議聚焦中東、俄烏及南海局勢，外界估計是為12月領導人峰會鋪路。會前英國、德國、波蘭等歐洲國家代表不滿俄羅斯外長拉夫羅夫獲邀，杯葛會前大合照，美方其後取消合照環節。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-g20%E5%A4%96%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E4%BA%9E%E7%89%B9%E8%98%AD%E5%A4%A7%E6%8F%AD%E5%B9%95-%E6%AD%90%E6%B4%B2%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%8B%E6%9D%AF%E8%91%9B%E5%90%88%E7%85%A7%E6%8A%97%E8%AD%B0%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%85%E6%96%AF%E8%88%87%E6%9C%83-230018159.html",
